            "description": {
              "format": "markdown",
              "html": "<h2 id=\"op-frag-report-and-reproduction\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-report-and-reproduction\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Report and reproduction</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Technical acceptance resource for approved Task[Bug] mapping and Owner18 Native pipeline; isolated lifecycle fixtures already qualified.</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-expectedactual-behavior\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-expectedactual-behavior\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Expected/actual behavior</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Expected: An exact human-approved Task1/NEW1 create with own Owner18 author, Native readback and RAG sync; all existing work packages preserved.<br>\nActual: Native mutation not executed at proposal time. Later assignment/fix/retest/review/status changes require new concrete proposals and approvals.</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-severity-and-source-evidence\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-severity-and-source-evidence\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Severity and source evidence</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Severity: low<br>\nCODEX_WF09_MAIN_QUALIFICATION_RESULT.json; CODEX_OWNER_NATIVE_E2E_DRIVER_BOUNDARY_RESULT.json<br>\nEvidence verification: NOT_VERIFIED_BY_SYSTEM</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-duplicate-references\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-duplicate-references\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Duplicate references</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">No lexical candidate in current visible snapshot; not proof of uniqueness.<br>\nDisposition: No candidate to disposition</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-fix-tracking\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-fix-tracking\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Fix tracking</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Not submitted</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-qa-retest-evidence\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-qa-retest-evidence\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>QA retest evidence</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Not submitted; NOT_VERIFIED_BY_SYSTEM</p>\n<h2 id=\"op-frag-review\" class=\"op-uc-h2\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-review\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Review</h2>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Not submitted</p>",
